          <task>
            <workflow:InstructionTask>
              <instructions>Create or update the block 
org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.MyStory.bml 
that contains a random story in german 
about a tree and a mushroom. 
For each execution create a new poem.
The story should be structured with the following properties:
- title (type:Text)
- author (type:Text)
- story (type:Text)
- language (type:Text)
- date (type:DateTime)
- time (type:DateTime)
- location (type:Text)
- weather (type:Text)</instructions>
            </workflow:InstructionTask>
          </task>
        </workflow:AgenticOperation>
